[38;2;124;124;124m**Lemma**: Let $X$ be a scheme of finite type over a field $k$, and let $V [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\subseteq X$ be a non-empty open subset. Then $V$ contains a closed point of [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$X$.[0m

